        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "e87627bc-3428-5964-8b17-01ef211fcac5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Publications: Viva, Ainslee's Magazine, Strand Magazine, Redbook, The Lingerie Book\n- People: Patty Oja, Mitchell Gray\n- Works: The Prince and Betty, Mr. Mike's Mondo Video\n\nFacts:\n- Ainslee's Magazine was an American literary periodical published from 1897 to December 1926.\n- The Prince and Betty was originally published in Ainslee's Magazine in the United States in January 1912.\n- The Prince and Betty was published in a slightly different serial form in Strand Magazine in the United Kingdom between February and April 1912.\n- Viva was an adult women's magazine that premiered in 1973 and ceased publication in 1980.\n- Patty Oja appeared in the film Mr. Mike's Mondo Video, in Redbook and Viva magazines, and on the cover of Mitchell Gray's The Lingerie Book.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
